bled=\"disabled\" checked=\"checked\" class=\"appearance-none border-slate-300 checked:bg-slate-300 checked:hover:bg-slate-300\"/>\n      Incorporate more scaffolding and support\n    </div><div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" class=\"appearance-none border-slate-300 checked:bg-slate-300 checked:hover:bg-slate-300\"/>\n      Improve classroom management techniques\n    </div><div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" class=\"appearance-none border-slate-300 checked:bg-slate-300 checked:hover:bg-slate-300\"/>\n      Use different assessment methods to measure success\n    </div></div></div></section></div>",
